 War I and World War II massive combat airplane simulator.\n\nIn Dogfight Elite you can fly an airplane, drive a tank or jump out of the plane and defend your position as a soldier.\n\nYou can also play alone and fly through training levels all the way up to full-blown dogfights against enemy planes.\n\n\nIf you have any requests/complaints please visit www.dogfightelite.com forums.\nI keep track of all requests and complaints and fix them on each release. Write the details or contact me on the website. I will read your posts and fix it asap!", "short_description": "Online massive airplane combats against real pilots, tanks, and foot soldiers."}]}, "developer_name": "Joaquin Grech", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.dogfightelite.com/index.php/forum/4-announcements/1058-privacy-policy-and-terms-of-use", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.dogfightelite.com/index.php/forum/4-announcements/1058-privacy-policy-and-terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "Joaquin grech", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.dogfightelite.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": ["FLYING"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["de", "ru", "pt", "en", "pt_BR", "it", "fr", "es", "zh_TW", "ja", "zh_CN", "nl"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "942353629979707"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 5, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2997853187152412"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "722531825428163"}, {"status": "PU